('NZ:graphic-designer','2026-08-11',null,37.02,77000,0,0,0,0,15,6,0,5,5,31,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 232411 Graphic Designer.','shortage_note','Graphic Designer 232411 is not on the current 9 March 2026 Green List; no shortage credit is assigned.','visa_basis','Standard skilled-work treatment when the specific job and applicant meet current immigration requirements; no Green List credit; 5/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatū current most-common Graphic Designer annual pay range NZD 59,000-95,000; 6/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū shows 0-3 years of training and describes relevant graphics/design study plus a portfolio as the normal pathway; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:ux-designer','2026-08-11',null,55.29,115000,0,0,0,0,10,10,0,3,5,28,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Tahatū has a direct User Experience Designer career profile. ANZSCO 2021 contains 261113 User Experience Designer (ICT), but no ANZSCO 1.3 code is forced into this canonical NZ profile while the immigration classification layer transitions toward the NOL.','shortage_note','No current Green List occupation is matched to the canonical UX profile; 0/20.','visa_basis','A specific UX role must be classified by its duties under the applicable current immigration framework; classification ambiguity is scored conservatively at 3/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatū current most-common User Experience Designer annual pay range NZD 105,000-125,000; 10/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū shows 0-5 years of training and lists relevant design, communication/media or computing qualifications plus a UX portfolio; 10/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:multimedia-designer','2026-08-11',null,37.02,77000,0,0,0,0,12,6,0,5,5,28,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 232413 Multimedia Designer. This is distinct from ICT occupation 261211 Multimedia Specialist.','shortage_note','The current Green List includes Multimedia Specialist 261211, not Multimedia Designer 232413. No shortage credit is transferred across occupations; 0/20.','visa_basis','Standard skilled-work treatment for an appropriately classified multimedia-design job; no Green List credit; 5/10.','salary_method','Tahatū has no clean exact Multimedia Designer pay page in the reviewed layer. Midpoint of the current Graphic Designer range NZD 59,000-95,000 is used as a conservative transparent digital-design proxy; 6/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū multimedia-computing study options include one-year advanced diplomas and three-year bachelor routes covering graphics, animation, audio and video; 12/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
('NZ:animator','2026-08-11',null,53.13,110500,0,0,0,0,15,10,0,5,5,35,'career-opportunity-nz-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','ANZSCO 232412 Illustrator — Animator specialisation.','shortage_note','Animator/Illustrator 232412 is not on the current Green List; no shortage credit is assigned.','visa_basis','Standard skilled-work treatment when the role meets current classification and immigration requirements; 5/10.','salary_method','Midpoint of Tahatū current most-common Visual Effects Artist and Animator annual pay range NZD 65,000-156,000; 10/10.','entry_basis','Tahatū shows 0-2 years of training and emphasises relevant experience plus examples of work, with tertiary design/media study useful; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No statutory occupational registration; 5/5.'),'2026-08-11'),
